WEBVTT

00:00.560 --> 00:06.440
Hi, good evening. My name is Shipra Sarkar.
I'm from 4S Study Abroad Education Consultants based

00:06.440 --> 00:14.500
in Dubai, UAE. I would like to congratulate
Webincline on completing their 11 years of

00:15.040 --> 00:19.580
wonderful journey because they've been so helpful.
I think we've been working with them

00:20.160 --> 00:26.180
past 10 years now and so many things being an
education consultants we deal with different

00:26.180 --> 00:31.920
part of the world, different, you know, countries,
different universities, they've been

00:31.920 --> 00:37.320
always helpful for anything, whether you call it
as a lead generation or the events

00:37.320 --> 00:42.640
which we run. We run the campaigns with them.
We do our own exhibitions.

00:43.380 --> 00:48.880
Whenever we say we need so many footfalls,
we have more than what we expect from

00:48.880 --> 00:53.880
them. So definitely they've been very, very helpful.
I really like to

00:53.880 --> 01:00.220
congratulate the entire team and wishing you
all the success and achievement for future.

01:00.440 --> 01:02.360
Thank you so much, Webincline.
